  "content": "<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Better Leaves добавляет дополнительные слои к блокам листвы, делая их более пушистыми, плотными и естественными.</span></p>\n <img src=\"https://github.com/TeamMidnightDust/BetterLeavesLite/blob/dev/banner_p.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Баннер, показывающий блок листвы с текстом 'Better Leaves Performance Update'\"></img>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Версия 9.0 ориентирована на производительность, текстуры автоматически создаются для каждого вида листвы. В отличие от версии 8.1, здесь нет динамической генерации, поэтому вам нужно выполнить несколько простых шагов для сборки пользовательских версий, совместимых с текстурами. Я уже сделал это для программистских текстур Minecraft.</span></p>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/RL_--nShJ9w\" title=\"YouTube видео\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Настоятельно рекомендую установить мод <a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/cull-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cull Leaves</a> вместе с Sodium/Embeddium для увеличения FPS.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QXePegVz/images/388e3d201568ccb6bdaeaa6e0eedf3864bbe83d9.webp\" width=\"842\" height=\"219\" /></p>\n</center>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Явно поддерживаемые моды (v9.5):</summary>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/architects-palette\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architect's Palette</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ars Elemental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ars Nouveau</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aurorasdecorations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aurora's Decorations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Nether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bewitchment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bewitchment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biome-makeover\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Makeover</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blockus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blossom\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blossom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bountiful-fares\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bountiful Fares</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/chipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chipped</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/mod/croptopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Croptopia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dreamwoods\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dreamwoods</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees (+ Аддоны)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enderscape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Enderscape</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ends-phantasm\" rel=\"nofollow\">End's Phantasm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/eternal-starlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Eternal Starlight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forbidden-arcanus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Forbidden and Arcanus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fruits-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fruits Delight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/integrated-dynamics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Integrated Dynamics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lets-do-beachparty\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Beachparty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lets-do-bloomingnature\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] BloomingNature</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lets-do-meadow\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Meadow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lets-do-vinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Vinery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lighterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lighter End</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/natures-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Spirit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Exoticism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mariposa\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mariposa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystics-biomes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mystic's Biomes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/paradise-lost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paradise Lost</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/regions-unexplored\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tech-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tech Reborn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/terrestria\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terrestria</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/traverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether: Redux</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wilder-wild\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wilder Wild</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/windswept\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windswept</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n\n<center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Ищете обычную версию? Найдите её <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/better-leaves\">здесь</a>.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bNSRNhc/Better-Leaves-Logo.png\" alt=\"Логотип Better Leaves\" width=\"496\" height=\"129\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Понравился этот пак? Проверьте мой другой пак,&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/round-trees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Round Trees</strong></a><strong>.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/SVSvskd/Round-Trees-Logo2.png\" alt=\"Логотип Round Trees\" width=\"256\" height=\"67\" /></span>&nbsp;</p>\n</center>",
